# Passenger / Node app document-root helper
# If cPanel did not inject Passenger lines into public_html/.htaccess,
# ask your host to re-register the app, OR paste the CloudLinux block
# that Application Manager generates (do not invent paths).
#
# Your Application Path MUST be: onecallsolution  (NOT /)
# Then Restart the application after npm run build.

DirectoryIndex index.html
Options -Indexes
